type: software
title: "Stream macroinvertebrate structure and traits along a biological condition gradient, weighted by density and by biomass: analysis pipeline and data"
authors:
  - family-names: Sabat-Bonilla
    given-names: Sergio A.
    affiliation: "Department of Entomology, Virginia Polytechnic Institute and State University, Blacksburg, Virginia, USA"
license: MIT
version: 1.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-12
repository-code: "https://github.com/Ssabatbonilla/Chapter_2_Publication"
abstract: "R pipeline and data reproducing every analysis, table and figure of a study of 90 wadeable streams in three physiographic regions of the Chesapeake Bay watershed, in which community structure, functional traits, redundancy and inequality were screened against a within-region gradient of biological condition (Chessie B-IBI), each metric weighted by areal density and by biomass."
keywords:
  - stream macroinvertebrates
  - functional traits
  - functional redundancy
  - biomass
  - biological condition
  - Chesapeake Bay watershed
